WEBVTT

00:03:55.415 --> 00:04:00.846
and at no time have global emissions
been higher than today.

00:04:03.003 --> 00:04:04.184
So there I was,

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:07.215
seeing and understanding
the science on the one side,

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:12.295
but not seeing answers,
not seeing the action, on the other side.

00:04:13.684 --> 00:04:16.617
At that point, I had enough.

00:04:16.641 --> 00:04:20.048
I wanted to go to the UN
Climate Conference myself,

00:04:20.072 --> 00:04:24.624
that very place that was created
to bring people together

00:04:24.648 --> 00:04:26.511
to fix the climate --

00:04:26.535 --> 00:04:29.006
except not really, apparently.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.180
This was last year.